Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:43.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:53.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:55.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been taken against your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kobe? Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:07.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Phil? What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:11.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I was doing a show on teens with abandonment issues...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:13.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,and suddenly, I woke up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:16.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, those kids are gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know me, but I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:25.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You both play games with other people for a living...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,but, today, you play a game for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:32.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right now, you are both breathing in a deadly nerve gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:35.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have 120 seconds to reach the antidote...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:36.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:39.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! We better get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:41.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:44.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:53.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hit the metal arm with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:07.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:10.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shaquille, I'm not angry at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,but we are one minute away from death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.83,0:02:19.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just shut out the "No" voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:21.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Own your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:31.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just make the damn basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:37.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:40.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your feelings? To hell with your feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:42.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody with their feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I'm obese." "My kid's a brat." "Help me. Help me."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't I fix anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:53.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumb and worthless! Mama was right! Mama was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:57.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Pull yourself together. You're a brilliant doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:59.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - I just tell people to "get real."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not even a psychologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm... an electrician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:12.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I failed you, Shaq. I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Booyah! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,30 seconds left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,This will never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:36.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course- he wants us to cut through our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:39.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:43.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:45.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're probably not man enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess your mama was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:51.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:54.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's the coward now, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Candy from a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:03.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God! - I did it. We're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:06.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong? - Wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Motherfu-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one believed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,in the early years of the 21 st century
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,that our world was being watched...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:35.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,the way a man with a microscope might scrutinixe the creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:37.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,in a drop of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yet across the gulf of space
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:04.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,a terrible evil prepared to unleash itself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:08.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,upon an unsuspecting human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're up early. Come back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:27.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:54.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:03.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you missed me. Oh, I missed you too. God, you look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:06.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to come by to thank you for setting up that job interview for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:10.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:12.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just need something to keep me busy now that Cody's out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:14.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,He just turned 11 .
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I enrolled him in military school last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:18.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be a great program.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boy, kids, you know, they just grow up so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:24.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I heard that you were dating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:26.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, I bet she's brainy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Quixotic."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,90 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:45.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, your work with the elderly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:46.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,really inspired me, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:50.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, they have so much to teach us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:52.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we have so much to teach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:55.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, ultimately, they... really are just like us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,only... older.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:01.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm hoping that a new career will help
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,keep my mind off of... bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have memories, too. He's the kind of person you never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I wake up in the middle of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,wondering where he is, and then I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:19.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you miss him, too, but it's really been hardest on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm rattling on, but if you don't vent your emotions...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:24.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,they just well up inside of you and burst out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:27.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,The harder you try, the harder it all gets...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,till you just can't shake it off anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:31.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:34.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like you're carrying around this enormous burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes your problems get so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And then what do you say to yourself? - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:45.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can turn to religion or family and friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:47.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,but in the end, you're still in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why I want to become a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:54.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just- I'm so in tune with everyone's emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:57.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess I've always had a knack for being-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my'God
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:29.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ryan, go home. You've been working 16 straight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, I need the overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:36.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm wide-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:43.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ryan! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was gold bullion-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not the monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:58.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:05.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Tom! What the hell happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, Ed. That could've happened to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:10.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? You know what your problem is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:13.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,As soon as the going gets tough, you give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right. I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, you don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:20.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could be the best, if only you'd see things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:23.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know. - Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:26.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What can I tell you, Ed? I guess I'm no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I just don't have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? You secured that tricky H-500 unit, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on. That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom Ryan. I haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I spend every waking minute of my life operating a crane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,God, I hate my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, Tom! Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mahalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, C.J., this is my boy Tom Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:03.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We used to work together down at the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Tom. How's the family, man? - You remember Marilyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:10.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your lovely wife, how could I forget? - She dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. I slept with her a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys talking about Marilyn? Great lay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,My pops introduced me to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:22.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever since the divorce, it's like my life has no purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:24.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Half the time I walk around feeling like a xombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:26.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, don't joke about xombies. That shit there- that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, you know Nashawn, down on 120th Street?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:32.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,She told me that she heard a xombie going through her trash the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,The next morning, she turned up missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Uh... - What? Okay, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,How in the hell do you "turn up missing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:41.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Cause nobody knows where you are when they realixe you ain't there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, I'm trying to ask-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:46.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you telling me that you can appear and disappear at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:48.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, man. You can't appear and disappear at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:50.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The bitch ain't David Copperfield! - Uh, guys-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mmm. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you can't be gone from one place and show up somewhere else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:56.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,So when you turn up, you're never missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when you're missing, you never turn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:02.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless... you a xombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:03.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.69,0:11:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's some plausible shit right there. You should blog about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:09.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put that on MySpace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:09.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what you need to do, man? You need to get away from all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You need to take a break. - Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:20.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no. He's right, man. You should come fishing with us one weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me and Mahalik, we found this great spot last summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:26.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. A great spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:36.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. You cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- L-Little bit. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Look, man, um-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not on the down-low or nothing, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:55.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's cool, man. Me, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:01.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what you doing? - Relax, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:03.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to grab some nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:13.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,C.J., what are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I just wanna eat some peanuts. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:19.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? Peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:33.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been alone with you inside my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:36.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,And in my dreams, I've kissed your lips
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,A thousand times
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:48.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I sometimes see you pass outside my door
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:51.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it me you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:59.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see it in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:02.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see it in your smile
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're all I ever wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:09.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And my arms are open wide
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cause you know just what to say
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you know just what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:22.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I want to tell you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:28.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah... we caught a lot of fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:36.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Black cod.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:45.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom, you don't- I don't want you thinking that-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:47.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, this doesn't affect your opin-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:49.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that, and that's my first time meeting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Late again, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:07.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Marilyn. - I thought you were moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all I can afford right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You took everything in the divorce except my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, actually, the judge granted me that yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're now officially known as "Horace P. MacTitties."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your new husband is pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:22.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a good man. A provider, unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:24.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never cared about our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:27.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not true. I'm a great dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:30.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:38.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Dad. - Hey, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:41.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's it going there, uh... Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:44.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Let me help you with that, muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I should do that. - It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I honestly don't mind. - Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. You take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:57.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see you on Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:58.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Marilyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a good look for you, being pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not pregnant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't meant to- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you want to make things right, maybe you should start with our kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:14.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right. Those kids are all I have in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:17.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, the kids... and my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:20.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:26.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Koji, looks like we need someone new for the Norris account.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every day we don't have someone looking after this woman, I lose big money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:35.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened to last girl? - Yoko. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone put a towel under her or something. Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the Norris house, Mr. Koji. They say it's cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,There no such thing as a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:50.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Those just old wives' tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:54.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need someone there today or I'm in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:15:59.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm Cindy Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:01.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a job in home health care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:05.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was recommended by a family friend, but unfortunately, he committed-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:08.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't mind her. She slip and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:13.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You my new best employee. Ready start today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:15.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so fast. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, trust me. Uh, you're gonna love this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, I show you. We can be there 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come! Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:48.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Koji?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:53.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:05.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:07.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, let's get you up and... - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:12.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, come on. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:14.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'm sorry. - There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see you've met Mrs. Norris- she catatonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was just trying to get her back up on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that she would be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:23.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, when I came in, I just saw her lying here on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, of course. I help. You grab her legs, I grab her arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Norris, I'm here to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm very happy to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:36.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? This job perfect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me show you rest of house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:40.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:48.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. There's something strange about this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:50.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A presence. - A presence? Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nothing wrong with this house. - It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:56.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I always dreamt I would live in a house like this with my husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:59.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I guess that's all just in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:01.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who wants to see upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:08.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a nice neighborhood close to schools and shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:11.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are hardwood floors throughout. Passed almost every inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Big backyard goes back 100 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:23.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,And in here is the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:24.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very big, very...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:28.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:32.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems like it'd be a great place to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:35.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I just can't shake this feeling of... evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Evil? That craxy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.15,0:18:44.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about the people who used to live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:48.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,People? No, nothing about people. I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:51.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Koji, did something strange happen in this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Strange? Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,This house perfectly normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:59.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're right, and yet... it's as if someone's watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Koji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was me... just excited about hiring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very, very enthusiastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:16.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,We offer medical and dental and two weeks' paid vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:20.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping... you can start today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe get in a whole week!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:24.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You put in for this job...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,we got wonderful opportunities for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.49,0:19:29.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Koji, is there something you're not telling me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:38.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was... dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:43.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,So... the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:53.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your glove! I'm in the backyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:56.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robbie, come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:59.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not how you're going to get through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:01.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Rach, this is guy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Robbie, you ready for the Tom Ryan Express?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:21.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe, one day, I can grow up to be just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:24.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, I know I let you kids down...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:27.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,but you have no idea how hard it is to be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:31.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, when you start, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,My eyes! My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:51.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, much... better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm so sorry. - Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've taken balls to the face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:00.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi. I'm Cindy Campbell, your new neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom, Tom Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, uh, live here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm-I'm taking care of Mrs. Norris...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:10.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,but... yes, for the first time in my life, I'm on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:12.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:16.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It wasn't always that way. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You thought you'd found your soul mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:22.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then one day you come home...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:26.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,and find your so-called soul mate in bed with a complete stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:29.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, not a complete stranger- Sammy Sosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.49,0:21:36.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:39.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I do know what it's like to be in that much pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.39,0:21:42.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the worst part is you have to suffer through it-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alone? - It looks like we have a lot in-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:47.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Common.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're already finishing each other's... - Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:53.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:58.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well... maybe all we really need is a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:01.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:03.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get back to Mrs. Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:06.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's time to put her catheter in, and then after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got to scrub in between her fat folds...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I've got to lance her boils.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.55,0:22:12.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got to open her up and then-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:45.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,...empty the colostomy bag and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.39,0:22:47.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,mop up the drool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:52.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll see you around? - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:54.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:58.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mrs. Norris, time to dig out that doody bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:06.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa... Oh! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.59,0:24:24.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Norris?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.69,0:24:27.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed anything strange about this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:30.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! Yes! - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.33,0:24:31.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:34.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're probably right. Guess I'm just being silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.37,0:24:38.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just relax now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.27,0:24:41.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.07,0:24:44.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you poor thing. You don't have to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:47.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.54,0:24:50.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I think you and I are going to be wonderful friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:54.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I do. That's right.Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:57.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get in those ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:00.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.26,0:25:03.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right. Oh, it feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.06,0:25:08.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:11.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You love this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:14.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nice and warm. Feels good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:17.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:20.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:42.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.19,0:26:44.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.19,0:26:46.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's toss the old pigskin!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.70,0:26:55.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.34,0:26:58.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I didn't see you there. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.31,0:27:00.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. My throat cushioned the blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.98,0:27:04.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank God. I lost my temper. My son's-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.65,0:27:06.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You look scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing. It's just-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:11.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's something going on in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last night, I saw a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.76,0:27:16.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Did it have a nose? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.49,0:27:18.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,That does sound like a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.33,0:27:21.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then there was this weird hand in the shower...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:24.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,and this horrible thing on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:26.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't go through this all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.60,0:27:29.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. There's some other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You still love him, don't you? I wish you both the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.91,0:27:35.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:39.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's painful to talk about, but you deserve to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.75,0:27:44.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was married once.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:46.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out the way, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.03,0:27:48.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't call me no bitch! You ain't shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.53,0:27:50.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut your ass up, snow ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.86,0:27:56.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well... actually, married twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.30,0:28:00.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,My husband and I were living our dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.44,0:28:04.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, your challenger, Cindy Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.11,0:28:09.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay loose, Cindy. Remember your training. Keep your focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.55,0:28:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Always think, where's the next punch coming-
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.58,0:28:17.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,After 20 fights, I was undefeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:19.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only one fighter stood between me and the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.49,0:28:21.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got this chick. She's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:23.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tiffany Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.97,0:28:30.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.47,0:28:33.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you're scared, but I believe in you. You can win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.24,0:28:34.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if I do win, George,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.72,0:28:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,then will you tell me what my nickname means?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.61,0:28:38.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:41.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now just stick with the jab and lead with your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.41,0:28:43.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch your footwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:46.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:56.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa! You do that one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.49,0:28:58.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm taking a point off, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:03.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got it, I got it! Dude, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.01,0:29:13.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.99,0:29:26.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's when I lost my cool
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.16,0:29:28.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,and made the biggest mistake of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.53,0:29:30.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.70,0:29:33.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a nickel!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.74,0:29:42.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.91,0:30:25.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.38,0:30:27.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,George!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:31.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:34.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't have thrown that punch, none of it would've happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.82,0:30:37.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I blame myself for it all. - As well you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.69,0:30:41.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, Cindy, the past is the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:44.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you ought to think about your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.43,0:30:46.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I'm ever going to love again...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.50,0:30:48.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,it has to be with somebody who'll be there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:52.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't have a great track record in that department.Just ask my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.41,0:30:55.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have. What's an "cock monger"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:58.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh... that's not really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:01.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,What matters is I've let a lot of people down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.35,0:31:03.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:06.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I should go. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:11.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not meant to be happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.36,0:31:16.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,but something about you makes me want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.45,0:31:37.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's happening? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.56,0:31:43.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is the sky so dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.13,0:31:45.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is the wind moving towards the storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't any of us have driers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.57,0:31:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never seen clouds like that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.85,0:32:03.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can you believe that thunder? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.85,0:32:08.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,That storm is so fierce. I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.89,0:32:11.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I haven't either. - Imagine being out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:15.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,That last one sounded really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.13,0:32:18.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry- lightning never strikes in the same place twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.23,0:32:23.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Rachel? - I thought she was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.65,0:32:39.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. That's it. We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.98,0:32:42.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,That last bolt of lightning smelled like a-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:44.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Giant turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:48.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, the... lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.89,0:32:51.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.23,0:32:57.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn it again, see if it'll start.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:33:00.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on. The car's not working, it's just not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.60,0:33:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.67,0:33:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.64,0:33:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,My bowels have stopped moving! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.15,0:33:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How's it going, Marvin? - I just had this car working: now it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.32,0:33:16.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Try changing the solenoid. - Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.99,0:33:19.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Death to America!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.06,0:33:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.91,0:33:45.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.03,0:34:38.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.13,0:34:40.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.27,0:34:44.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's your ride, G? - Move it, dawg!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.29,0:35:03.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:06.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Haro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.46,0:35:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hibachi. Benihana. Teriyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.53,0:35:12.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nagasaki. Okinawa. Hokkaido. Yokohama.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.80,0:35:16.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Karate.Judo. Sumo. Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.81,0:35:20.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nissan. Honda. Mitsubishi. Subaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.81,0:35:24.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hara-kiri. Tsunami. Kamikaxe. Banxai.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.71,0:35:28.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yamaha. Nikon. Casio. Aiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.22,0:35:34.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Minolta. Hitachi. Seiko. Toshiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.16,0:35:36.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddha! Shitake kimono!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.73,0:35:41.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tempura. Sushi. Sashimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.66,0:35:43.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fujitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:52.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.61,0:35:55.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.12,0:36:02.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go, honey! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.42,0:36:05.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robbie, Dad's home!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:11.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:13.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.28,0:36:28.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dad, talk to me. What's happening? - There's no time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:30.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alien attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.18,0:36:33.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, that about sums it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.12,0:36:35.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fill this up with food. We're leaving this house in 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.39,0:36:41.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,My ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.86,0:36:45.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.56,0:36:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cindy! - Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.24,0:36:57.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Run for it! - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:37:01.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone's out there, somebody who knows a way to stop all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.18,0:37:03.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you wouldn't understand. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.35,0:37:06.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come with me. - Oh, I'd like to, but my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I... guess this is good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.89,0:37:13.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,When this is all over, promise me that you'll find me, that you'll never forget me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.46,0:37:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,that you won't give up until I'm back in your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.43,0:37:18.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alive? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.83,0:37:20.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.17,0:37:25.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.84,0:37:32.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.61,0:37:36.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,A solenoid... for luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.02,0:37:49.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marvin! You put a solenoid in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.59,0:37:51.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got one from that crackhead over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get in. - Why should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.73,0:37:57.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because you're my responsibility now, and like it or not, I'm all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.13,0:38:00.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.60,0:38:03.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey. Hey! - Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.94,0:38:06.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.14,0:38:09.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get in the car, Marvin. - Come on, Tom, stop joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.15,0:38:11.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in the car, Marvin, or you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:14.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.05,0:38:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, wait for me to... - Still locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.99,0:38:22.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why are you reaching at the same time? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.66,0:38:24.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right, on three. - You counting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:26.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.63,0:38:28.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, on three. - One, two-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.03,0:38:30.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.80,0:38:33.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't do that. You're trying to annoy me. - It's still locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:35.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going on three. One, two-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.24,0:38:36.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't count when I count. I have a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.91,0:38:38.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's the matter with you? - Turn your mouth sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.78,0:38:40.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- If you look at me I lose count. - What are you craxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.04,0:38:43.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One, two, three! - Two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.45,0:38:45.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't do it the same time. - You said "three."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.85,0:38:47.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You go on "four." Can you count? - Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.45,0:38:49.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So on your "three" or my "four"? - There's only one "three".
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:52.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm tryin' to get in the car. - Then you do it on "four."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.32,0:38:55.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You said, "three". So are you doin' it on "three" or am I doin' it on "two"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.09,0:38:56.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- For Christ's sake! - I heard "three."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.99,0:38:58.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,If the count is "three," you do it on "four."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.63,0:39:00.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now it's "four". - Why would you go on "four"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.30,0:39:02.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gave me "four" first and you stole my "four."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:03.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But I have to count to "three" first. - You stole my "four."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.97,0:39:06.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just let me say "three." - I've got wait on you now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.44,0:39:07.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You want the black man to wait again? - Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.07,0:39:11.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's what I've been doin'. - Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.07,0:39:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would you reach for it when I say "three"? That's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do I still go on "four"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:17.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,When I say "three," don't worry about "four."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.48,0:39:18.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got all the time in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:23.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can go home, watch television and come back and then open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:24.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fine. - One-
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:26.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No "one." I'm out. No thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.06,0:39:30.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take the next one. Does that work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.69,0:39:32.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jesus. - Attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.03,0:39:36.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'd rather be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.87,0:39:41.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,"A girl had a pet duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.07,0:39:43.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,"She fed and took care of her pet duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.34,0:39:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,"But one day, the duck got loose and ran away from the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:50.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,"The duck ran down the road and kept running...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.71,0:39:52.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,until he found a pond."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.45,0:39:56.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we've just received word...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.15,0:39:58.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,the planet is under attack by aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:00.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.19,0:40:01.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,"The duck went back"-
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.02,0:40:04.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir? They've already wiped out some of our cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.99,0:40:07.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, they'll kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.46,0:40:09.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, I'll handle that in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.73,0:40:13.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,But right now, I need to find out what's happening with the duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:17.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, with each passing moment, more people will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.21,0:40:19.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,The people are gonna die regardless...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.71,0:40:22.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,but this duck still has a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.38,0:40:27.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've read the story before, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:29.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,The duck dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.65,0:40:33.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,My God! That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.22,0:40:36.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, the aliens? We're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.33,0:40:39.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean, right now all of these children's parents could be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.70,0:40:43.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kids! Kids, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not as bad as it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.74,0:40:47.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,They didn't die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.05,0:40:49.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they died with all the other people you loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.97,0:40:53.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.34,0:40:56.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, of course not. There's no such thing as Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.78,0:41:02.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like the Tooth Fairy, completely made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.15,0:41:05.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Easter Bunny- Never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.86,0:41:09.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The female orgasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.13,0:41:12.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait and see what happens when you try to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:16.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Your parents all getting divorces?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:19.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can give them a little advice, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.44,0:41:22.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.34,0:41:25.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right now, let's go on to another story, "Rumpelforeskin."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.68,0:41:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Stiltxkin," sir. We have to get you to the White House.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.44,0:41:30.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just don't get kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.18,0:41:33.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Remind me to sign that abortion bill. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.76,0:41:47.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You may leave through the forward exit doors...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.60,0:41:49.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,or the gaping hole in the side of the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.93,0:41:51.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,We realixe you have a choice in airlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we appreciate you flying with Southern Coast Air.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.24,0:41:56.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.84,0:42:02.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's mine! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.15,0:42:06.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cindy? - Brenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.98,0:42:10.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.55,0:42:12.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.02,0:42:14.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought you were dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.06,0:42:19.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here? Were you on this plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.53,0:42:21.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I'm trying to get a good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.66,0:42:24.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a reporter now. I work for the local news.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.47,0:42:26.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really doing well for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.14,0:42:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was on assignment. Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.74,0:42:31.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here's Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.21,0:42:35.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,And here's Detroit after the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.48,0:42:40.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.35,0:42:43.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,The attack was devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.09,0:42:45.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's over, Cindy. Humanity has lost the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.86,0:42:47.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no. There's still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.92,0:42:50.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have reason to believe that there's someone here that has the answers...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.79,0:42:54.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,maybe even a way for us to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.13,0:42:57.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. It would make a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.53,0:42:59.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe. But how are we supposed to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.94,0:43:01.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,None of these cars work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.94,0:43:03.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. See if this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.81,0:43:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! I got the last working car in New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.18,0:43:13.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is our road, bitches! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.85,0:43:20.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right, Cindy. That worked pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.62,0:43:21.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.97,0:43:33.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at all the injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.90,0:43:35.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.77,0:43:39.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Big-ass rat, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.34,0:43:41.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! That sewer took forever to fix!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.31,0:43:44.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm gonna need a hot bath after all of that-
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.08,0:43:45.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.63,0:43:53.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Zombies! - Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.87,0:43:56.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.74,0:43:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let 'em bite you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.47,0:44:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good news! They can still feel electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.34,0:44:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grandma? The xombies have got my grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.55,0:44:08.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Die, Grandma! Die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.35,0:44:12.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I loved you! I loved you! - Mahalik?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.09,0:44:14.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look what they did to my grandmama!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.52,0:44:17.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.36,0:44:21.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,That woman raised me from birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:31.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's got a car. He's got a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.94,0:44:33.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give us the car and the keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.01,0:44:37.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't my car. I would, but I can't. It's not my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.68,0:44:41.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not my car. Don't worry, kids. The doors are locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.58,0:44:43.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no possible way they can-
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.35,0:44:46.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull the robot out of chocolate. But that's just common sense. Oh, waiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.26,0:44:50.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Daddy! - Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:57.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.73,0:45:01.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.07,0:45:03.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.20,0:45:06.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.18,0:45:12.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gimme the gun. I'm taking the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.85,0:45:14.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do I do about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.92,0:45:17.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want the car. I just need a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.32,0:45:19.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,No way I'm giving up the gun. I want the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.65,0:45:23.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you need a gun, and you want a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you want? - Well, I've never owned a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.99,0:45:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's all switch on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.73,0:45:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.60,0:45:36.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.64,0:45:39.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.41,0:45:44.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, they're taking the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:48.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, uh, let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.35,0:45:51.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? That's it? You're giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.35,0:45:53.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right. I'm giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.75,0:45:56.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want a hero? Go find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.16,0:45:58.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.96,0:46:02.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.66,0:46:05.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, let me get this straight:
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:09.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,The girl hugged the duck, and then it dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.07,0:46:11.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, the nation is under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.71,0:46:13.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me Homer Landsquiddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.47,0:46:15.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean, "Homeland Security."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.55,0:46:20.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, this woman was an eyewitness to one of the attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.31,0:46:22.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What can you tell us? - They're indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.98,0:46:25.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,The clothing was burned off everyone's bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.72,0:46:28.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,There were naked people everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.42,0:46:30.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Were you naked? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.96,0:46:32.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank God. Some good news at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.83,0:46:34.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get her a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.68,0:46:58.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lil' Kim- Lil' Kim got my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.72,0:47:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out- Russell Crowe's got a phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.56,0:47:05.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,R. Kelly, don't pee on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.23,0:47:08.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,My lovely lady lumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:10.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.43,0:47:13.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but I think we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.70,0:47:17.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be near mile 62.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.24,0:47:18.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:21.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.41,0:47:24.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I met this guy, and I wonder if he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.91,0:47:26.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'd love him, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.91,0:47:29.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's his name? I might've already loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.05,0:47:31.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.89,0:47:35.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, did him. Big, fat Chinese guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.09,0:47:38.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,No... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.26,0:47:41.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,But he is the kind of guy that I'd like to share the rest of my life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.77,0:47:48.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.81,0:47:58.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.58,0:48:01.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but the boy's father's somewhere in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.38,0:48:03.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll have to sneak our way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we're not gonna blend in dressed like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.45,0:48:08.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Brenda, look. - He's a wonderful boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.72,0:48:38.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exekiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.02,0:48:40.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exekiel, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.53,0:48:50.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exekiel, shall we have a foot race?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.86,0:48:52.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,No cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.69,0:49:17.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.32,0:49:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.63,0:49:27.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Friends, friends. Do not fear the noise of those of whom we do not speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.53,0:49:29.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is a gentle truce between our village
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.80,0:49:32.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the creatures beyond their borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.41,0:49:34.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, who would like to say grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.34,0:49:36.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.31,0:49:38.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, Exekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.45,0:49:41.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pee-pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.52,0:49:44.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pee-pee vagina.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.69,0:49:48.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.93,0:49:59.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.23,0:50:01.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,For what purpose do you interrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.37,0:50:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,the celebration of the domestic partnership
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.84,0:50:11.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,of Mordecai and Hoss?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.21,0:50:13.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guards caught two outsiders near the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.85,0:50:21.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.36,0:50:24.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I must speak with you. I was sent by your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.49,0:50:26.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.63,0:50:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I have no son. - That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.96,0:50:31.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know who you are. I've seen the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.33,0:50:34.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I was young. I needed the work. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.54,0:50:36.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,At Mrs. Norris's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.20,0:50:38.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't know whose house it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.67,0:50:41.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,They drugged me. Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.18,0:50:45.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're outsiders. The council will decide your fates.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.42,0:50:54.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,The question of the outsiders is now at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.02,0:50:58.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,But first, Martha, have you some tidings?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.69,0:51:01.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nathaniel Winston and Alice Smith
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.13,0:51:03.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,have informed me of their intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.16,0:51:06.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,He intends to have sex with her as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.43,0:51:10.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,She intends to put up a mild fight and then give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.01,0:51:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Amos, something does trouble you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.08,0:51:25.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We now have a majority of those who wish to say "I'm"...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.55,0:51:27.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,instead of"I am."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.96,0:51:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm for that. - I am against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.43,0:51:33.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.79,0:51:35.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have more important matters to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.73,0:51:39.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I fear that the presence of the outsiders
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.27,0:51:42.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,will attract those of whom we do not speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.80,0:51:46.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you talk about those of whom we do not speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.07,0:51:48.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,have you not spoken of that
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.44,0:51:50.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,about which we do not talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.31,0:51:53.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not speak of that of about which
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.31,0:51:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,we talk of not speaking... about.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.43,0:52:11.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elder Hale. We should welcome the outsiders among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.17,0:52:14.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jeremiah, ought not your tongue be held?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.70,0:52:17.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, Elder Hale...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.50,0:52:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,but sometimes my tongue wiggles beyond my ability to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.61,0:52:27.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a problem with which I have had much experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.48,0:52:30.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could help him in a room in which there are no others.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.95,0:52:34.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or you can all watch. I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.25,0:52:37.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.79,0:52:45.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,After this, how about you take your thing of which we do not speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.33,0:52:47.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,and slide it up in my place of which I like-
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.60,0:52:49.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.60,0:52:51.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,The elders will consult.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.48,0:53:02.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah. Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.35,0:53:39.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not in my house, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.35,0:53:41.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:49.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Outsiders, we have decided to let you stay with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.23,0:53:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,so that you'll be safe from those from of whom we do not-
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.60,0:53:54.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.80,0:53:56.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.37,0:53:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,But now that you are a part of our village...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.47,0:54:01.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,understand this:
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:03.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You may never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.81,0:54:07.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did your son die?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.72,0:54:12.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The fate of the world is at stake. - You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.32,0:54:13.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was it you? Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.05,0:54:15.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is some shit up with which we will not put.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.06,0:54:18.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm for that. - I am against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.90,0:54:25.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,This village isn't what it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.57,0:54:30.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just hours after the devastating alien attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.00,0:54:34.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,world leaders have gathered at the United Nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.37,0:54:37.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,In this, mankind's darkest hour...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.14,0:54:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,the human race has turned, as one...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.55,0:54:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the wisdom and leadership
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.55,0:54:44.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,of the President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.15,0:54:48.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, the President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.16,0:54:50.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.19,0:54:52.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,They mean you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:54.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.07,0:55:07.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,So... an Indian, a Frenchman and the Pope are all on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.34,0:55:11.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,The pilot says, "Hey, are any of you not circumcised?"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.31,0:55:14.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,So the Pope lifts up his robe and says...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.31,0:55:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Shut up, stupid. You don't even speak English."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.62,0:55:20.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Israeli asked theJapanese guy to open his eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.02,0:55:23.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,but theJapanese man says, "I'm not squinting, you craxyJew.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.52,0:55:26.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the one who sold me these cheap glasses."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.96,0:55:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the difference between a Belgian and a lump of dog shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.70,0:55:33.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Belgian drinks wine, but the dog shit smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.67,0:55:41.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, on a serious note, I'm here today at the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.34,0:55:45.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,"un"... because the Earth has been attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.21,0:55:48.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to report that we may have found a way to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.15,0:55:50.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,My military advisers at the Pentagram
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.72,0:55:52.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,have managed to do the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.55,0:55:56.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,They have captured one of the alien heat ray guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.29,0:56:00.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,As you know, the heat ray destroys the body, leaving behind nothing but clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.63,0:56:03.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our engineers have managed to reverse the polarity of the weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.86,0:56:07.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,in the hopes that it can now be turned against
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.23,0:56:09.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,the alien invaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.57,0:56:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.68,0:56:19.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. We expect that the alien shields will be vulnerable
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.91,0:56:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,to this reconfigured weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.38,0:56:27.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,People, please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.82,0:56:33.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, people. Now, I know that this new technology may seem frightening...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.23,0:56:36.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I believe that deep down inside this heat cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.73,0:56:38.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,is our best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.23,0:56:40.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.73,0:56:43.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if this thing is plugged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.01,0:56:48.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh... it's not a very pretty sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.24,0:56:50.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything's loose and flapping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.58,0:56:52.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at this little pink thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.59,0:57:02.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone get some lubricant, and we'll slather it around in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:05.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.74,0:57:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Harper. Good God, these people are all naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.97,0:57:24.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame? Have you no decency?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.41,0:57:26.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sir, you're naked, too. - I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.75,0:57:29.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought this was a wrinkly leather coat. - Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.48,0:57:31.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- These aren't buttons? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.15,0:57:33.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been pulling this thing up and down like a xipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.55,0:57:35.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.29,0:57:37.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,There goes that duck again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.80,0:57:45.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, man, you see this red weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.80,0:57:47.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.87,0:57:49.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, how much further till Mom's?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.87,0:57:51.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.77,0:57:54.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much longer I can carry your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.44,0:57:57.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been walking this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.81,0:58:00.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Then who the hell is... - I'll pay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.48,0:58:03.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay close, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.15,0:58:06.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.65,0:58:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! You guys! I want to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.52,0:58:11.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robbie! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.09,0:58:16.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move. For God's sake, stay right there. I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.53,0:58:19.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, you guys! I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.94,0:58:23.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.77,0:58:26.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait! - Are you craxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.44,0:58:28.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! They'll pay for half my college.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.98,0:58:31.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kick ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.91,0:58:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.81,0:58:35.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! - What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.82,0:58:39.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that guy. This is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.15,0:58:44.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Robbie! Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rachel! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.97,0:58:55.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little girl, are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.34,0:58:57.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,You need to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.47,0:58:59.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you safe, right, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.54,0:59:00.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.04,0:59:03.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you have a little brother? - Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.58,0:59:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run away, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.08,0:59:10.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Toward the tripod, if you have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.85,0:59:13.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't go! I've got a Ferris wheel and a chimp...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.25,0:59:15.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,and a big, soft bed we can all get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.23,0:59:22.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.70,0:59:23.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not my real face!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.06,0:59:25.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not my real face!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.00,0:59:28.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.67,0:59:35.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.34,0:59:38.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Follow me to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.51,0:59:41.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ow! - Follow me to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.72,0:59:44.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know about this. - I'm an excellent judge of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.72,0:59:47.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.38,1:00:15.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.38,1:00:16.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.68,1:00:21.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.12,1:00:24.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have learned quickly and produced splendid butter.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.89,1:00:27.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you have not churned before?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.43,1:00:29.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we don't call it churning where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.64,1:00:39.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pee-pee vagina.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.62,1:00:55.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! Into the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.62,1:00:58.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.22,1:01:01.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the cellar. That's the cesspool.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.33,1:01:02.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.47,1:01:06.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.69,1:01:30.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boogedy-boogedy-boogedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.22,1:01:32.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boogedy-boogedy-boogedy-boogedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.46,1:01:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're not monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.56,1:01:39.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Old Lady Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.20,1:01:41.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Pig-FaceJoe!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.81,1:01:48.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.74,1:01:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.31,1:01:52.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,He has suffered a heart attack
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.95,1:01:54.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,brought on by this knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.38,1:01:58.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.35,1:02:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was... Exekiel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.12,1:02:04.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Henry, you need a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:06.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not too late. We can help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.76,1:02:09.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could start by not leaning on the knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.00,1:02:14.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not be concerned for him, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.73,1:02:18.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have sent our most qualified villager for medicines.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:33.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.35,1:02:35.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, leave me alone with Cindy and Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.02,1:02:37.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have much to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.13,1:02:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am not long for this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.20,1:02:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Pussy. - Brenda!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.23,1:02:51.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? 50 Cent got shot nine times. He's still walking around.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.10,1:02:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Henry, who killed the boy? Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.24,1:02:58.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I loved him and his mother very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.14,1:03:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should have been with him when he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.21,1:03:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.55,1:03:04.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened? You must tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.65,1:03:06.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,They went to a boxing match.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.89,1:03:09.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a women's championship title fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.79,1:03:13.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,And there was a terrible accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.69,1:03:15.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.74,1:03:28.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only in America!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.38,1:03:36.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,All this time, I've been searching for his killer
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.15,1:03:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,when it was me, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.18,1:03:40.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.19,1:03:42.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Henry, your son told me that if I found his killer...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.99,1:03:44.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would know how to defeat the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.02,1:03:47.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he was right. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.03,1:03:51.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.47,1:03:56.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who the hell let his ass out of jail?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.64,1:03:58.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,His brother, the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.77,1:04:04.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fuckin' "A."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.65,1:04:11.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you go, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.95,1:04:18.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, nothing's gonna happen to you. I haven't lost anyone yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.16,1:04:21.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've lost Robbie. - Except Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.69,1:04:26.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,None of that matters right now. What's important is that I'm here with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.17,1:04:28.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try and get some sleep, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.37,1:04:31.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sing me "Lullaby and Good Night"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.21,1:04:35.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.64,1:04:38.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sing me "Hushabye Mountain"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.24,1:04:40.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Rachel, I don't that one, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.06,1:04:53.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want this money
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.09,1:04:55.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you gotta be a bad bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.20,1:05:00.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shake that ass for a tip if you a bad bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.83,1:05:04.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop down to the floor if you a bad bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.37,1:05:07.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, she ain't no ho
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.11,1:05:09.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,She a bad... bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.05,1:05:19.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.55,1:05:22.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.22,1:05:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The name's Oliver. - Tom Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.16,1:05:29.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I found this place. Plenty of food-
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.90,1:05:33.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Along with two freshly killed busybodies upstairs...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.83,1:05:37.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,who "owned" the place. We could stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.10,1:05:39.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you afraid? - Of course I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.94,1:05:42.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not. I've been around death plenty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.18,1:05:44.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I used to drive an ambulance in the city...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.74,1:05:48.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,but, apparently, I wasn't a very strong driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.41,1:05:50.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems I was killing more people than I was saving.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.82,1:05:53.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something about that siren got me excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.59,1:05:57.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wham! Carnage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.22,1:05:59.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,But this is different. This is a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.73,1:06:02.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's an extermination.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.10,1:06:04.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's no more of a war than there's a war between men and maggots...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.93,1:06:07.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,or dragons and wolves...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.33,1:06:11.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,or men riding dragons, throwing wolves at maggots.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.54,1:06:15.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Tom. Can't you understand what I'm trying to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.31,1:06:17.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,These aliens must have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.88,1:06:20.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard that theJaps killed a few of'em over in Kikkoman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.35,1:06:23.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kikkoman. That's-That's soy sauce.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.25,1:06:25.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, yeah. Low sodium.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.08,1:06:28.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to say, Tom, is that you and I should be fighting these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.32,1:06:30.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's us that should be coming up from under the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.79,1:06:32.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, we'll have to bury ourselves first...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.93,1:06:34.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,but it'll be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.33,1:06:36.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cool breexe. No sunblock. Worms.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.53,1:06:39.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we build our own tripods, they'll have four legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.60,1:06:41.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I gotta show ya something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.44,1:06:47.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll tunnel up from behind and scare the piss out of'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.95,1:06:55.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wish we had some shovels, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.62,1:07:06.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.96,1:08:15.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.50,1:08:17.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.67,1:08:23.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rachel! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.85,1:08:35.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the secret, Brenda? What am I missing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.98,1:08:40.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! More fake monsters?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.86,1:08:52.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.28,1:09:11.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.85,1:09:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promised I'd find you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.64,1:09:32.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are we? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.51,1:09:35.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some kind of basket attached to the tripod.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:37.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.38,1:09:40.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, it's horrible. But why?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.35,1:09:42.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are the aliens gonna do to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.25,1:09:44.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but they're taking everyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.25,1:09:46.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,young, old, rich, poor, Chingy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.13,1:10:00.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Daddy! - Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.30,1:10:03.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Daddy! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.77,1:10:05.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.51,1:10:18.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.25,1:10:20.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.06,1:10:32.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Brenda! - Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.57,1:10:35.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey... could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.17,1:10:41.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You want to switch? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.51,1:10:44.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brenda, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.48,1:10:48.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it! The aliens killed a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.25,1:10:56.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, humans. Welcome to the inside of the command tripod.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.16,1:10:59.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Rachel? What have you done with my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.69,1:11:03.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,All in good time, Tom. But first, I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.63,1:11:07.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,The devices you wear will trigger in 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.50,1:11:11.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,The switch on the wall behind Cindy will disable them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.04,1:11:13.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But where is the key?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.97,1:11:15.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hint, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.01,1:11:18.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.81,1:11:22.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I... I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.62,1:11:27.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay... maybe this will help you "see."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.19,1:11:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want me to... cut something?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.86,1:11:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,That should be obvious, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:44.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.77,1:11:49.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!The key is behind your eye, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.82,1:11:59.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zoltar, get in here! This one's gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.19,1:12:05.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fake eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.52,1:12:07.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bad bar fight in '96.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:14.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.27,1:12:20.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh... oh, I hope this doesn't come between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.27,1:12:22.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.05,1:12:31.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it too late for me to try this on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.75,1:12:33.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Silence! The game is not yet over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.12,1:12:37.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Rachel! - Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.86,1:12:40.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Rachel! - Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.23,1:12:48.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,The only thing keeping your children alive, Tom, is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:51.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we had a good run.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.71,1:12:57.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ha! You weren't expecting that, were you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.44,1:13:00.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I was counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.15,1:13:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I call it... "the nutcracker."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.92,1:13:10.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.92,1:13:13.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.33,1:13:24.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tempura. Sushi. Sashimi!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.44,1:13:30.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my- Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.78,1:13:34.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course. Follow the blood. Henry was his stepdad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.45,1:13:36.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the little boy's real father!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.02,1:13:38.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where did you even meet her?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.98,1:13:41.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was spring break in Cabo. So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.52,1:13:43.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I blended in. Seriously, who gives a crap?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.92,1:13:45.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.76,1:13:49.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your purple nurple, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.97,1:13:55.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, your son wouldn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.13,1:13:57.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,His soul walks the Earth because of the pain you've caused him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.00,1:14:00.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I have crossed a galaxy for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.71,1:14:02.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it's my fault. Let the others go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.98,1:14:06.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't think so. Look upon him as he writhes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.21,1:14:09.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cindy! Look, I'm on TV, y'all! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.68,1:14:11.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give a shout out to all my peeps!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.22,1:14:15.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.99,1:14:18.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one... bitch slaps... Brenda!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:20.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zoltar, help!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.73,1:14:24.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh! This is some bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:27.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you hold a grudge against humanity for your son's death, but-
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.67,1:14:30.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, wet willy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.07,1:14:33.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Killing us won't bring your little boy back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.37,1:14:36.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. You will all pay for what you have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.34,1:14:38.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, I've already built this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.88,1:14:42.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,When the trap closes on you, it will lock the chain in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.02,1:14:45.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your children will be saved...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.08,1:14:47.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,but you will suffer a terrible death.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.75,1:14:50.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you hang on to the ones you love?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.49,1:14:52.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.19,1:14:57.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. - Don't worry, kids. I won't quit on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.40,1:15:01.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay to let go, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.40,1:15:03.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,All you ever had to do was show that you loved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.24,1:15:07.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,And show me what it means to be a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.57,1:15:10.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,And show me that I could love again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.28,1:15:13.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,We forgive you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.22,1:15:26.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,The spikes- they stopped!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.86,1:15:32.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Kids! - Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.57,1:15:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you... sparing our lives?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.61,1:15:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone can hold a grudge...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.61,1:15:43.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,but it takes real courage to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.98,1:15:47.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The invasion is over. - And?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.98,1:15:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I guess I'm sorry or something. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.12,1:15:52.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.82,1:15:54.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.82,1:15:57.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for killing millions of people. Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.49,1:16:00.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait... where's Brenda?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.76,1:16:04.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.46,1:16:06.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're at peace now. I was just sealing the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.13,1:16:11.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Brenda. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.54,1:16:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, Zoltar! Don't lose my number!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.54,1:16:19.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me you didn't catch something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.61,1:16:22.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's cool. She said she was a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.72,1:16:27.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are so fucked.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.30,1:16:44.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.11,1:16:50.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.81,1:16:54.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, kids, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.52,1:16:58.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, that's my new husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.02,1:17:09.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think it's romantic- the way love can find anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.57,1:17:17.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,And so, love triumphed in the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.10,1:17:19.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the invaders were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.47,1:17:22.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,For this world, our world...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.27,1:17:24.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,is the world of man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.31,1:17:27.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have earned the right to live here...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.41,1:17:31.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,and as long as we love, humanity will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.85,1:17:35.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Each of our enemies has failed in their quest to defeat us...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.75,1:17:40.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,each has been undone by their own nefarious plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.56,1:17:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Among all worlds, across all galaxies...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.10,1:17:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,we stand above, we stand alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.83,1:17:52.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,None can threaten our existence, none can challenge our spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.54,1:17:54.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,And why?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.54,1:17:57.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of all the qualities that make us unique...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.91,1:18:00.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,it is love that is our greatest strength...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.65,1:18:03.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,and because of love, mankind-
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.32,1:18:10.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Hello, and welcome to the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.62,1:18:14.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have got a very special man with some very special news.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.46,1:18:17.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right- he's in the building! The man who saved the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.76,1:18:20.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put your hands together for Tom Ryan!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.10,1:18:25.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! - My best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.65,1:18:36.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:44.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wow. - That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.42,1:18:46.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.33,1:18:53.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So, you're in love. - I am. I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.84,1:19:01.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's lost it. The boy's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.31,1:19:03.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:12.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You are adorable when you are in love. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.25,1:19:15.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tell us all about her. - She's great. She's really terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.62,1:19:17.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,So it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.36,1:19:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you were saying that-that she's complex, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.69,1:19:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:33.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ow! - You're insane. Tom Ryan is insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.47,1:19:35.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm insane! - Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.57,1:19:37.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're happy? - I'm so happy. Hey! Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.61,1:19:42.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.41,1:19:44.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tom. Okay, you've got balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.99,1:19:50.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.62,1:19:52.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoe!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.26,1:19:59.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love Cindy Campbell!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.83,1:20:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can jump on things!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.30,1:20:05.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.05,1:20:17.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ya-ha! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.69,1:20:23.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, um, Tom... isn't Cindy here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.56,1:20:26.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know she's here. Cindy, I know you're in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.39,1:20:28.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cindy! Cindy! - Cindy! Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.79,1:20:33.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's bring her out right now! - I love this woman! I love this woman!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.27,1:20:45.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! God!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.31,1:20:48.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《惊声尖笑4》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:43.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:53.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:55.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只是被绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,是科比吗 你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,菲尔教授 到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:11.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道我正在参加一个有关被遗弃孩子的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:13.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,忽然间 我就在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:16.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 那些孩子一定会气疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也许不认识我 但我认识你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:25.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都是靠玩游戏挣钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是今天 你们要为你们自己的生命玩一个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们正在吸入一种致命的毒气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:35.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有120秒的时间找到解药
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:36.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,否则你们就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:39.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 我们一定要想办法出去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:41.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们的游戏开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:44.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,看那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:53.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,用什么东西去砸那根铁柱子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,用那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:07.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:10.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,沙科尔 我不是对你发火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,但还有一分钟我们就要见阎王了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.83,0:02:19.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,忘掉你的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:21.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:31.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,快他妈的投中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:37.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你伤了我的自尊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:40.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的自尊 让他们都见鬼去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:42.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都有自尊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,"我发胖了""我孩子很不懂事""帮帮我吧"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他们都滚蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么我谁也帮不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:53.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我实在是太笨太没用了 妈妈说得对 妈妈说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:57.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 别这样 你是个好医生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:59.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我只会跟人说"要现实"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我根本不是一个心理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 是一个电工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:12.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对不起你了 沙科 我对不起你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有30秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,这没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 他要我们割自己的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:39.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你先来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:45.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来你不够有勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你妈妈说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:54.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说我是胆小鬼 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:03.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 我成功啦 我们得救啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:06.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 锯错脚了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,奶奶的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,在21世纪初
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人相信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:35.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,正被别人像显微镜那样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:37.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,窥探着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是在广阔的宇宙中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:04.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个邪恶的势力正跃跃欲试
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:08.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备要对毫无防备的人类发动总攻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你起的真早 回床上来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:27.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你想我 我也想你 天哪 你看起来气色不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:06.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想过来对你说声谢谢 帮我要来这次工作的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不太适合
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:12.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在科迪走了 我想该找点事做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:14.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,他都11岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去年把他送去军校
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:18.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想这会是一项好的历练的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,男孩子们 你知道的 他们总是这样突然长大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:24.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说你又开始约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:26.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想肯定是个聪明的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,"狂想家"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,90分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:45.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你为老人们的做的那些工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:46.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的对我影响很大 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:50.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 他们总有那么多值得我们去学的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:52.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也有很多可以教他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:55.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕竟 他们其实跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是 老了些
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:01.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我希望新的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,能够帮我忘记那些不愉快的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你也一样 他是那种让人一生难忘的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时候我会突然在深夜惊醒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,回想他在哪里 然后我就明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:19.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你也在想他 但我想最受打击的人还是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我说得有点多了但有时如果不能把情绪抒发出来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:24.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们只会越积越深 然后爆发
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:27.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你越努力 事情就越糟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到你不能承受为止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:31.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:34.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像你带着个沉重的包袱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时候问题会越来越严重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 然后你怎么办呢 - 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 你可以求诉于宗教 家庭 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:47.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是到头来 你还是在那团迷雾中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许正因为这样我想成为一个护士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:54.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是 总是那么能了解其他人的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:57.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我总是有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:29.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,赖安 回去吧 你已经连着工作了16个钟头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要很需要那加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:36.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我清醒得
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:43.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,赖安 你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些是金条
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 那些猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:58.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:05.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的 汤姆 刚才发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德 谁都有可能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:10.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗 你知道你的问题在哪儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:13.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,每次事态严重的时候 你就放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不明白我说什么 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:20.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你能明白那些东西 你会是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:23.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不想听了 - 不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:26.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该说什么呢 埃德 我想我也许还是不适合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我没有那个能力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么 你不是搞定了那个H-500吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 那个太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆 赖安 好久没见你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,每当我醒着的时候 我都在操作那些起重机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 我真的受不了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 汤姆 你去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,马哈里克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,CJ 这是我的老朋友汤姆 赖安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:03.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾经一起在码头工作过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 汤姆 你的家人怎么样 - 你记得玛里琳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:10.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你可爱的妻子 我怎么会忘记 - 她跟我分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我知道 我跟她睡过几次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在说玛里琳吗 功夫不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我兄弟介绍我认识她的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:22.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,离婚以后 我简直就觉得我的生活失去了意义
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多时候我都觉得自己成了一具行尸走肉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:26.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万不要拿将是开玩笑 他们是存在着的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你认识120街的纳尚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:32.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,她告诉我她有次听见有僵尸走过她的垃圾堆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二天早上 她就看来不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 恩 - 什么 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,她怎么能"看来不见"呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:41.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为没有人能看到你 如果你失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想问
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:46.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说你能在失踪的时候被人看见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:48.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 你不能在失踪的时候被人看见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:50.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那人又不是大卫 科波菲尔 - 恩 兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是不能去了一个地方 然后又同时在另一个地方出现
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:56.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要你被人看到 你就不是失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦你失踪了 就不会被人看到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:02.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非 你是个僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:03.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.69,0:11:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的真是经典 应该放到网上好好宣扬宣扬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:09.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把它放到MySpace上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:09.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要阿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你该做什么吗 你应该把这一切都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你该休息一样 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:20.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不不 他说得没错 你应该跟我们一起来钓鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟马哈里克 我们在去年夏天找到了个很妙的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:36.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你冷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有一点 - 恩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟 恩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是什么同性恋之类的 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:55.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,恩 没问题 我也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:01.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你要干什么 - 放轻松 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:03.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是来拿些坚果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:13.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,CJ 你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我只是想吃点花生 - 恩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:19.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,看见了没 花生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:33.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾在脑中跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:36.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我的梦中 我亲吻着你的双唇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时我见你在门前经过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:51.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是你在寻找的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:59.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以在你的眼中看到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:02.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以在你的微笑中看到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是我一直想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:09.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的双臂永远为你敞开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该知道该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:22.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:28.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 我们捉了好多鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:36.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,黑鳕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:45.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆 你不要 我希望你不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:47.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望这不会影响
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:49.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样做 我们才第一次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又迟到了 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:07.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 玛里琳 - 我以为你已经搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在只能负担这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,除了我的名字你把什么都在离婚协议里夺去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你错了 法官昨天刚把那个判给我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在叫"贺瑞斯?P?麦可蒂"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你的新丈夫一定很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:22.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是个好人 不像你 他能负担我们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:24.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你从来不关心我们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 不是这样的 我是个很称职的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:30.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:38.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸好 - 好啊 雷切尔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:41.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近过得怎样 我的小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:44.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,门上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 让我来帮你吧 小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我来吧 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我无所谓的 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:57.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,星期二见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:58.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 玛里琳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看起来不错 怀孕的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你想补过的话 还是好好跟我们的孩子相处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:14.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得没错 那些孩子是我唯一剩下的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:17.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子 还有我的车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:20.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:26.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯吉先生 我想我们需要派一个新人到诺里斯家去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一天我们没有人去照顾她 我们就要损失很多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上次的那个女孩呢 - 尤可 你看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿块毛巾放在她下面 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯吉先生 有人说诺里斯的房子闹鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,从来没有闹鬼这么一说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:50.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,这只是些无聊的道听途说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:54.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定要找个人来顶替 要不我就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:15:59.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 我是辛迪 坎贝尔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来应征家庭护理员的工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:05.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是经一个朋友推荐的 可惜他已经自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:08.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用理她 她不小心滑了一跤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:13.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我最好的新员工了 可以今天开始工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:15.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 那太快了 真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我 你会喜欢这份工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,来 跟我一起去 10分钟就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,来 来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯吉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:53.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:05.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:07.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我扶你起来 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:12.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,来 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:14.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 对不起 - 你在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经见过诺里斯太太了 她有紧张性精神症
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我只是想扶她去床上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怕她会受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:23.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我进来的时候她就躺在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 当然 我来帮忙 你拿她的脚 我拿她的手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,诺里斯太太 我是来照顾你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我也很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:36.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,看见没 你很适合这份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我带你去看看房子其余的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:40.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:48.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道 这房子有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:50.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有某种东西存在着 - 东西 别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这房子没什么奇怪的 - 很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:56.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直梦想着跟我的丈夫 住在这样的房子里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:59.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想这只是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,从前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想看看楼上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:08.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这社区不错 有学校有商店
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:11.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,硬木质地板 每次都通过检验
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,100尺大的后院
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:23.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿是浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:24.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,很大 很
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:28.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:32.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想这应该是个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:35.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是我一直有种 邪恶的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,邪恶 开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.15,0:18:44.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道曾经在这儿住过的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:48.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,人 不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:51.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯吉先生 这儿是不是有发生过奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,奇怪 别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这房子很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:59.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你说的对 只是 我总觉得有人在注视着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯吉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我 太兴奋能有你这样的雇员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常非常的高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:16.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们提供健康及牙医服务 还有两个星期的带薪假
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:20.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你今天就可以开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,先做一礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你能接受的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,以后还会有更多的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.49,0:19:29.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯吉先生 你是不是在对我隐瞒什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:38.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是 有点脏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:43.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,那 工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:53.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿上你的手套 我在后院
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:56.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比 快来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是跟他沟通的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:01.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷切尔 这是男人之间的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得对我有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比 你准备好搭乘"汤姆 赖安快线"了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:21.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许有一天我也会变成像你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:24.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 我知道我曾经让你们失望
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:27.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你们不知道做一个父亲是多么的难
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:31.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你准备开始的话 告诉我一声
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的眼睛 我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:51.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 好 多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的脸也曾经被球击中过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:00.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 我是辛迪 坎贝尔 你的新邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆 汤姆 赖安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你 恩 一个人住那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在照顾诺里斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:10.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 确实是第一次一个人独立
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:12.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:16.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是总是那样的 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时你以为终于找到了一个知心的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:22.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,但有天你回到家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:26.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,发现那个所谓的知心的人变成了一个彻彻底底的陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:29.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许不完全是陌生人 塞米 索沙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.49,0:21:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 从来没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我知道那种痛苦的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.39,0:21:42.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,但最悲惨的是你需要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一个人度过 - 看起来我们有很多的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:47.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们已经在为对方完成 - 晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:53.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,句子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:58.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想 也许我们都需要一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:01.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望那样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:03.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看我得回诺里斯太太身边了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:06.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,该是时候把她的导尿管放好 然后再
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,把她全身上下都擦干净
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,切开她的脓包
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.55,0:22:12.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他们打开 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:45.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,清理结肠口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.39,0:22:47.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,拖干地上的口水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,太美妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:52.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我还会再见到你吗 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:54.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:58.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 诺里斯太太 是时候清理掉那些泡泡了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:06.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇哦 哦 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.59,0:24:24.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,诺里斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.69,0:24:27.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉察出这房子有什么不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:30.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的 是的 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.33,0:24:31.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你说的对 我想我是太紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.37,0:24:38.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.27,0:24:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.07,0:24:44.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜的人 你不用害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:47.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来照顾你的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.54,0:24:50.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们会成为很好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来擦擦耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:00.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.26,0:25:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 感觉很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.06,0:25:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:11.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:14.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,温温的很舒服 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:17.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 哦 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:20.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:42.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.19,0:26:44.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.19,0:26:46.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们好好的来一场
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.70,0:26:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.34,0:26:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 我们没有看见你 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.31,0:27:00.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事 我咽了口气
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.98,0:27:04.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 我失去冷静了 我儿子他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.65,0:27:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你看起来很惊慌
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 没什么 只是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:11.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,那房子有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨天晚上我看到一张脸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.76,0:27:16.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他有鼻子吗 - 有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.49,0:27:18.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,那应该是张脸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.33,0:27:21.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有我洗澡时的那双奇怪的手
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:24.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,楼梯上恐怖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:26.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我不能再承受更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.60,0:27:29.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我明白了 是一个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还爱着他 对吗 我祝你们白头偕老
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.91,0:27:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:39.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许说起来很痛苦 但你有权利知道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.75,0:27:44.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾经结过一次婚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:46.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我走开 婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.03,0:27:48.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有什么资格骂我 你这臭屁虫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.53,0:27:50.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.86,0:27:56.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,恩 事实上 是两次
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.30,0:28:00.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我丈夫和我在实现着我们的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.44,0:28:04.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 今天的挑战者 辛迪 坎贝尔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.11,0:28:09.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,放轻松 辛迪 记住你的训练 保持注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.55,0:28:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,总是想着 下一拳会从什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.58,0:28:17.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经保持20场不败
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:19.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我离金腰带只差最后一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.49,0:28:21.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以赢她的 她没什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:23.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂芬尼 斯通
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.97,0:28:30.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛迪 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.47,0:28:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你很害怕 我对你有信心 你可以做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.24,0:28:34.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我真的赢了 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.72,0:28:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我我的诨名有什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.61,0:28:38.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:41.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 坚持用短直拳 注意右边攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.41,0:28:43.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:46.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:56.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 你如果再这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.49,0:28:58.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就会扣你的分了 听见了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:03.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的 我的 你们快看哪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.01,0:29:13.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.99,0:29:26.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在那时我失去了冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.16,0:29:28.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,犯了一生中最大的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.53,0:29:30.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛迪 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.70,0:29:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 五分钱
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.74,0:29:42.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.91,0:30:25.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走开
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.38,0:30:27.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:31.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:34.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果不是我出了那一拳 这些事就不会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.82,0:30:37.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得这都是我的责任 - 我想你应该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.69,0:30:41.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 辛迪 过去的就让它过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:44.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你该想想你的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.43,0:30:46.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我要再次相爱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.50,0:30:48.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,那应该是一个一直在那里等我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:52.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我在这方面的表现不太好 问问我儿子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.41,0:30:55.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经问了 什么叫"鸡巴贩子"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:58.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,恩 这不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:01.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,最重要的是我让很多人都失望
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.35,0:31:03.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:06.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我该走了 - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:11.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我的一生都不怎么快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.36,0:31:16.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我总觉得你有什么 让我想去尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.45,0:31:37.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.56,0:31:43.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么天这么黑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.13,0:31:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么风会向着风暴的方向刮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么我们没有人有烘干机
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.57,0:31:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从来没有见过那样的云
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.85,0:32:03.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你敢相信那雷吗 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.85,0:32:08.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那风暴太强了 我从来没见过这么大的风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.89,0:32:11.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 想象一下在外面的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:15.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才那个听起来好近
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.13,0:32:18.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用害怕 闪电从来不会击中同一个地方两次
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.23,0:32:23.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷切尔在哪里 - 我以为她在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.65,0:32:39.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 完了 我们没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.98,0:32:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后一下闪电闻起来像是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:44.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,大便的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 那 闪电
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.89,0:32:51.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去找罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.23,0:32:57.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,再转转试试 看看他会不会启动
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:33:00.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道怎么了 汽车就是发动不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.60,0:33:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.67,0:33:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.64,0:33:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的肠子不动了 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.15,0:33:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 马文 - 我刚把这辆车修好 现在又不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.32,0:33:16.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 试试看换个螺线管 - 好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.99,0:33:19.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.06,0:33:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.91,0:33:45.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,跑
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.03,0:34:38.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,衣服不错
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.13,0:34:40.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.27,0:34:44.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的车在哪儿 - 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.29,0:35:03.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:06.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.46,0:35:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你住这儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.53,0:35:12.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的日文太差了 对我的耳朵简直是种污染
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.80,0:35:16.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.81,0:35:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我被杀了 我的冤魂四处游荡
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.81,0:35:24.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,真可怜 我的身世也很悲惨
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.71,0:35:28.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定认错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.22,0:35:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道打败外星人的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.16,0:35:36.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 快告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.73,0:35:41.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,方法在我父亲的心脏里 跟着血迹走
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.66,0:35:43.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:52.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看不懂这个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.61,0:35:55.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.12,0:36:02.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走 亲爱的 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.42,0:36:05.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比 爸爸回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:13.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.28,0:36:28.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 快告诉我发生什么了 - 没有时间解释了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:30.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,外星人袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.18,0:36:33.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上这就是事情的本质
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.12,0:36:35.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,装满食物 我们要在60秒内离开
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.39,0:36:41.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.86,0:36:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.56,0:36:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 辛迪 - 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.24,0:36:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快跑阿 - 你去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:37:01.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人知道怎样可以阻止这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.18,0:37:03.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会懂的 - 我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.35,0:37:06.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 跟我来吧 - 我也想 可是我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 想这可能是说再见的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.89,0:37:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,当这一切都结束的时候 一定要来找我 不会忘了我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.46,0:37:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要让我回到你的怀里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.43,0:37:18.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 活着 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.83,0:37:20.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.17,0:37:25.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见 辛迪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.84,0:37:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.61,0:37:36.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,螺线管 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.02,0:37:49.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,马文 你把螺线管放进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.59,0:37:51.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我从那家伙这里搞来一个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快进去 - 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.73,0:37:57.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我要对你们负责 不管怎样 我是你们唯一的亲人了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.13,0:38:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.60,0:38:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 嘿 - 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.94,0:38:06.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.14,0:38:09.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快进来 马文 - 汤姆 别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.15,0:38:11.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,快进来 要不你死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:14.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.05,0:38:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 等我 - 还是锁着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.99,0:38:22.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么你总是要同时间去开呢 - 你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.66,0:38:24.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我数三下 - 你要数了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:26.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,一 二 三 开门
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.63,0:38:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好 到三 - 一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.03,0:38:30.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.80,0:38:33.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要这样 你快把我弄烦了 - 还是锁着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:35.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来数三下 一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.24,0:38:36.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,别在我数的时候数 我会受影响
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.91,0:38:38.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到底在干什么 - 把头转过去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.78,0:38:40.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你看着我我没法数 - 你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.04,0:38:43.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一 二 三 - 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.45,0:38:45.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别同时跟我做 - 你说了三
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.85,0:38:47.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那你就在数四的时候吧 你会数数吗 - 四
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.45,0:38:49.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是你的三还是我的四 - 只有一个三
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:52.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我只想要进来 - 那就在数四的时候做
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.32,0:38:55.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说三的 到底是你在三的时候做还是我在二的时候做
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.09,0:38:56.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的天哪 - 我听见三了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.99,0:38:58.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我数三下 你就应该在四的时候做
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.63,0:39:00.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 现在是四了 - 你为什么要四
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.30,0:39:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你先给我四的 现在你又要把它拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但我要先数三 - 你偷了我的四
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.97,0:39:06.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 总之让我说三 - 我要等你对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.44,0:39:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还想让黑人等着 - 随你的变
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.07,0:39:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我一直都在做 - 你为什么要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.07,0:39:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要在我数三的时候做 这是问题的关键
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是在四的时候做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:17.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说三的时候 不要管四
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.48,0:39:18.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:23.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以回家 看看电视 然后再回来开门
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:24.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 一
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不要一了 我投降 谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.06,0:39:30.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我坐下一辆 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.69,0:39:32.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 态度有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.03,0:39:36.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,说真的 我宁愿去死
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.87,0:39:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个女孩有一只宠物小鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.07,0:39:43.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,她时常照料和喂养着它
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.34,0:39:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是有一天 那鸭子不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,那鸭子在路上一直跑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.71,0:39:52.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到它找到一个池塘
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.45,0:39:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,总统先生 我们接到消息
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.15,0:39:58.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球正遭受攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:00.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.19,0:40:01.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,那鸭子回去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.02,0:40:04.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生 他们已经摧毁了我们的一些城市
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.99,0:40:07.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们再不行动的话 我们就会被打败
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.46,0:40:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道了 我等下会处理的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.73,0:40:13.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,但现在 我要知道那些鸭子怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:17.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生 现在过去的每一秒里 都有人在死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.21,0:40:19.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,人总会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.71,0:40:22.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,但那鸭子还有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.38,0:40:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我读过这故事 总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:29.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,那鸭子死了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.65,0:40:33.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天哪 这太恐怖了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.22,0:40:36.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,总统先生 那些外星人 我们正遭受攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.33,0:40:39.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说现在这些孩子的父母都有可能被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.70,0:40:43.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不像看起来那么糟
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.74,0:40:47.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们并不是独自死的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.05,0:40:49.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想他们一定跟你们爱着的其他人一起死的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.97,0:40:53.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说圣诞老人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.34,0:40:56.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 当然不是 根本就没有圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.78,0:41:02.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像牙仙一样 都是编造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.15,0:41:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,复活节小兔子 从来就没有
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.86,0:41:09.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,女性高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.13,0:41:12.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,根本不可能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:16.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你父母想要离婚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:19.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以给他们一点建议 如果你们想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.44,0:41:22.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我忘了 他们都已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.34,0:41:25.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 我们来下一个故事"割去包皮"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.68,0:41:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,"斯蒂尔斯基"先生 我们要尽快送你去白宫
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.44,0:41:30.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我总是不懂那些孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.18,0:41:33.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 记得让我签那些堕胎提案 - 是的 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.76,0:41:47.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以从前门离开机舱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.60,0:41:49.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是从两边的逃生门
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.93,0:41:51.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们知道你们有很多的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们乘坐南方海岸航空
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.24,0:41:56.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.84,0:42:02.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 那是我的 我找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.15,0:42:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 辛迪 - 布伦达
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.98,0:42:10.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 真的好久没见了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.55,0:42:12.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.02,0:42:14.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.06,0:42:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么 你在这飞机上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.53,0:42:21.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我只是想找个好新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.66,0:42:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在是记者了 在附近的新闻社上班
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.47,0:42:26.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 看起来你干得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.14,0:42:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当时正有一个采访任务 看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.74,0:42:31.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是底特律
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.21,0:42:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是攻击后的底特律
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.48,0:42:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.35,0:42:43.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,攻击力太强大了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.09,0:42:45.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛迪 人类已经输了这场战争
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.86,0:42:47.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 还有机会的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.92,0:42:50.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信有人会有解决问题的答案的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.79,0:42:54.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至还击的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.13,0:42:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 这会是个好新闻的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.53,0:42:59.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许吧 但我们怎么过去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.94,0:43:01.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些车都发动不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.94,0:43:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 也许这个会管用
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.81,0:43:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我找到了纽约最后一辆能跑的车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.18,0:43:13.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是我们的天下了 婊子们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.85,0:43:20.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得没错 辛迪 这挺管用的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.62,0:43:21.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.97,0:43:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看那些受伤的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.90,0:43:35.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.77,0:43:39.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,真他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.34,0:43:41.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 这下水道真难修
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.31,0:43:44.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我他妈的要去洗个热水澡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.08,0:43:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里他妈的到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.63,0:43:53.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 僵尸 - 妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.87,0:43:56.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.74,0:43:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让他们咬你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.47,0:44:02.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,好消息 他们能感觉到电流
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.34,0:44:05.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,奶奶 那些僵尸抓去了我奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.55,0:44:08.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,去死吧 奶奶 去死 去死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.35,0:44:12.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我爱过你的 我爱过你的 - 马哈里克
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.09,0:44:14.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看他们对我奶奶所作的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.52,0:44:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.36,0:44:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,那女人把我从小养大
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:31.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 他有车 他有车
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.94,0:44:33.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,把车跟钥匙给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.01,0:44:37.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是我的车 如果是的话我会给你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.68,0:44:41.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是我的车 别担心孩子们 车门都已经上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.58,0:44:43.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不可能可以
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.35,0:44:46.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,把机器人从巧克力堆里拉出来 这是常识 哦 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.26,0:44:50.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:57.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.73,0:45:01.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.07,0:45:03.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.20,0:45:06.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后 快退后
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.18,0:45:12.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪给我 这车是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.85,0:45:14.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,那他怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.92,0:45:17.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要车 我只要枪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.32,0:45:19.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不可能把枪给你的 我要那车
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.65,0:45:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以 你想要枪 你想要车
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要什么 - 我从来没有过刀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.99,0:45:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们数三声一起换
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.73,0:45:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.60,0:45:36.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.64,0:45:39.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来不是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.41,0:45:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 他们把车抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,是哦 恩 那我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.35,0:45:51.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么 就这样 你就放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.35,0:45:53.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 没错 我放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.75,0:45:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要一个英雄吗 找别人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.16,0:45:58.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.96,0:46:02.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.66,0:46:05.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来弄弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:09.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那女孩抱了抱鸭子 那鸭子就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.07,0:46:11.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,总统先生 我们国家正遭受攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.71,0:46:13.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我接"民族安检部"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.47,0:46:15.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是指"国家安全部"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.55,0:46:20.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生 这位太太看见了攻击的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.31,0:46:22.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你能告诉我们什么 - 他们是无敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.98,0:46:25.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人身上的衣服都被烧掉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.72,0:46:28.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,到处都是赤裸着的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.42,0:46:30.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是吗 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.96,0:46:32.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 总算有个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.83,0:46:34.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,带她去领份纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.68,0:46:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,林锦 林锦拿了我的三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.72,0:47:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意 罗素 克洛伊买电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.56,0:47:05.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯利 不要尿在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.23,0:47:08.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可爱的婴儿肥
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:10.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.43,0:47:13.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我想应该近了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.70,0:47:17.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该是在62公里处左右
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.24,0:47:18.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么不对劲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:21.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 只是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.41,0:47:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我遇见了个男人 我在想他是不是平安
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.91,0:47:26.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会喜欢他的 布伦达
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.91,0:47:29.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,他叫什么 我也许已经爱过他了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.05,0:47:31.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆 赖安
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.89,0:47:35.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我跟他上过 又肥又大的中国人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.09,0:47:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.26,0:47:41.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是那种我愿意托付终生的人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.77,0:47:48.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛迪 快看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.81,0:47:58.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.58,0:48:01.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 但那孩子的父亲应该在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.38,0:48:03.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得偷偷进去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我们的穿着没法不让人察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.45,0:48:08.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 布伦达 看 - 看起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.72,0:48:38.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊齐基尔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.02,0:48:40.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊齐基尔 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.53,0:48:50.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊齐基尔 我们来赛跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.86,0:48:52.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准作弊哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.69,0:49:17.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,是他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.32,0:49:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他看起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.63,0:49:27.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们 不要去理会来自我们从不提起的那些人的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.53,0:49:29.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们与那些外面的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.80,0:49:32.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一个停火协议
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.41,0:49:34.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,有谁要来感谢恩典
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.34,0:49:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.31,0:49:38.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊齐基尔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.45,0:49:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.52,0:49:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,尿尿的阴道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.69,0:49:48.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿门
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.93,0:49:59.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,神父
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.23,0:50:01.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要来打扰
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.37,0:50:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,末底改跟赫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.84,0:50:11.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.21,0:50:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,护卫在小屋前面抓到两个外来者
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.85,0:50:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.36,0:50:24.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有事要跟你说 是你儿子叫我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.49,0:50:26.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.63,0:50:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我没有儿子 - 这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.96,0:50:31.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 我见过你的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.33,0:50:34.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我错了 我需要那份工作 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.54,0:50:36.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,是诺里斯太太的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.20,0:50:38.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道是谁的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.67,0:50:41.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们给我吃药 现在已经不重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.18,0:50:45.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是外来者 议会会决定你们的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.42,0:50:54.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有外来者的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.02,0:50:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过首先 玛撒有什么要报告的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.69,0:51:01.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,纳撒尼尔 温斯顿和艾丽丝 史密斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.13,0:51:03.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉了我他们的意图
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.16,0:51:06.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他想尽快和她发生性关系
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.43,0:51:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,她想稍微反抗一下然后放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.01,0:51:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿摩司 你有什么烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.08,0:51:25.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这大多数人说"俺"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.55,0:51:27.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,不说"我"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.96,0:51:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 俺同意这么说 - 我反对
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.43,0:51:33.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.79,0:51:35.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有更重要的事情讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.73,0:51:39.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我恐怕外人的出现
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.27,0:51:42.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,会吸引那些我们没说的人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.80,0:51:46.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你谈到那些我们没说的人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.07,0:51:48.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没有说到那些
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.44,0:51:50.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没谈的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.31,0:51:53.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要说到那些
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.31,0:51:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们谈到的没说到
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.43,0:52:11.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,赫尔长者 我们应该欢迎我们中间外来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.17,0:52:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶利米 你舌头就不应该折起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.70,0:52:17.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 赫尔长者
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.50,0:52:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,但有时我的舌头不随我的意愿摆动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.61,0:52:27.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对这个问题很有经验
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.48,0:52:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我可以在没有别人的房间里帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.95,0:52:34.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都可以看着 我才不鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.25,0:52:37.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.79,0:52:45.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这之后 把你那不能说出来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.33,0:52:47.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,滑进我想要的地方怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.60,0:52:49.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.60,0:52:51.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,长者会商议的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.48,0:53:02.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.35,0:53:39.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没在我的房间是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.35,0:53:41.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,没在
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,外来的 我们决定让你待在我们中间
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.23,0:53:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样你就远离我们不想 的威胁了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.60,0:53:54.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者说不要
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.80,0:53:56.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.37,0:53:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,但既然你是我们村的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.47,0:54:01.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要明白
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:03.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你永不能离开
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.81,0:54:07.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你儿子怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.72,0:54:12.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 世界的命运危在旦夕 - 你知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.32,0:54:13.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你吗 是你杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.05,0:54:15.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不该被这样对待的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.06,0:54:18.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 俺同意 - 我反对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.90,0:54:25.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这村子不是原来的样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.57,0:54:30.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在毁灭性的外星人攻击几小时后
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.00,0:54:34.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界元首聚集在联合国
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.37,0:54:37.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这人类最黑暗的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.14,0:54:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类同心同力
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.55,0:54:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,寄希望于
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.55,0:54:44.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国总统的智慧和领导才能
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.15,0:54:48.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 美国总统
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.16,0:54:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.19,0:54:52.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:54.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.07,0:55:07.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 印度人 法国人 和教皇在一架飞机上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.34,0:55:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞行员说"你们有人没割包皮吗"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.31,0:55:14.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,教皇就掀起袍子说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.31,0:55:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,"闭嘴 笨蛋 你不会讲英语"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.62,0:55:20.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,以色列人让日本人睁开眼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.02,0:55:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是日本人说"我没斜眼 你个犹太疯子"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.52,0:55:26.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是卖给我这便宜眼镜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.96,0:55:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,比利时人和一坨狗屎有什么区别
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.70,0:55:33.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,比利时人喝酒 但是狗屎气味不错
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.67,0:55:41.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,但 说点严肃的 我今天在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.34,0:55:45.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,"UN"因为地球遭受攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.21,0:55:48.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴报告我们已经发现了反击的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.15,0:55:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在五角大楼的军事顾问
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.72,0:55:52.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以完成不可能的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.55,0:55:56.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们已经缴获一把外星热射线枪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.29,0:56:00.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道 热射线毁掉身体 只留下衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.63,0:56:03.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的工程师成功地改变了 武器的极性
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.86,0:56:07.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望这样我们能
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.23,0:56:09.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,对抗外星侵略者
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.57,0:56:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.68,0:56:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我们希望外星防护罩是脆弱的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.91,0:56:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,挡不住这重新装配的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.38,0:56:27.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,请安静
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.82,0:56:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这项新技术看上去吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.23,0:56:36.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我相信这热枪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.73,0:56:38.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我们最好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.23,0:56:40.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你们演示一下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.73,0:56:43.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,先看看这东西插进去没有
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.01,0:56:48.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,里面很美观
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.24,0:56:50.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,都松了 上下晃动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.58,0:56:52.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这粉色的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.59,0:57:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿点润滑油来 在这多涂点
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:05.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.74,0:57:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈珀 天啊 这些人都裸体了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.97,0:57:24.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不觉得羞耻吗 你不懂礼仪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.41,0:57:26.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 先生 你也是裸体的 - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.75,0:57:29.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我以为这是有皱纹的皮革大衣 - 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.48,0:57:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有纽扣吗 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.15,0:57:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我拉着这东西上上下下像拉链
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.55,0:57:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,总统先生 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.29,0:57:37.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.80,0:57:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计 看见这红草了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.80,0:57:47.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.87,0:57:49.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸 还要多久到妈那
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.87,0:57:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.77,0:57:54.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道还要抱着你妹妹多久
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.44,0:57:57.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在走
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.81,0:58:00.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那这他妈是谁 - 我会付你钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.48,0:58:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,挨近点 雷切尔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.15,0:58:06.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.65,0:58:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我要去帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.52,0:58:11.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.09,0:58:16.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动 待在这 我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.53,0:58:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我要去帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.94,0:58:23.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.77,0:58:26.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 你疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.44,0:58:28.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 他们要为我一半大学生活付出代价
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.98,0:58:31.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.91,0:58:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.81,0:58:35.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.82,0:58:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 看这家伙 真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.15,0:58:44.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗比 罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷切尔 雷切尔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.97,0:58:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,小女孩 你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.34,0:58:57.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以和我走
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.47,0:58:59.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会保护你的安全 对吧孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.54,0:59:00.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.04,0:59:03.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你又小弟弟吗 - 离她远点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.58,0:59:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.08,0:59:10.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果不得不 向三脚架那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.85,0:59:13.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,别走 我有观览车 大猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.25,0:59:15.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要大的软床 我们可以都上去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.23,0:59:22.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.70,0:59:23.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是我的真脸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.06,0:59:25.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是我的真脸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.00,0:59:28.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.67,0:59:35.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.34,0:59:38.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我到安全的地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.51,0:59:41.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 跟我到安全的地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.72,0:59:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不认识 - 我对角色判断很有一套
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.72,0:59:47.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.38,1:00:15.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.38,1:00:16.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 布伦达
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.68,1:00:21.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 你成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.12,1:00:24.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你学做上好奶油很快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.89,1:00:27.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定前面没搅过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.43,1:00:29.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们那里不叫"搅动"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.64,1:00:39.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,小BB
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.62,1:00:55.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,快 进地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.62,1:00:58.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.22,1:01:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这边是地下室 那边是污水池
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.33,1:01:02.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.47,1:01:06.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.69,1:01:30.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,波波－波波－波波
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.22,1:01:32.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,波波－波波－波波－波波
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.46,1:01:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们不是怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.56,1:01:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,亨德森大妈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.20,1:01:41.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要大脸乔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.81,1:01:48.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.74,1:01:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,是亨利
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.31,1:01:52.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,他心脏病发作了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.95,1:01:54.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,由这把刀引起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.38,1:01:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁干的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.35,1:02:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.12,1:02:04.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,亨利 你得去医院
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:06.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不是太晚 我们能救你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.76,1:02:09.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你得从不压在刀上开始
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.00,1:02:14.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别管他 辛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.73,1:02:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经派了最好的村民去弄药
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:33.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.35,1:02:35.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你 让我和辛迪和布伦达单独待一会
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.02,1:02:37.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有话告诉她们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,仔细听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.13,1:02:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我活不了多久了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.20,1:02:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 脓包 - 布伦达
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.23,1:02:51.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么 50分被射中9次 还活着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.10,1:02:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我 亨利 谁杀了那孩子 是你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.24,1:02:58.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是 我非常爱他和他的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.14,1:03:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他死时我应该和他在一起的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.21,1:03:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,真可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.55,1:03:04.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你必须告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.65,1:03:06.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们去看了拳击比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.89,1:03:09.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是女子冠军锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.79,1:03:13.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生了一场可怕的事故
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.69,1:03:15.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.74,1:03:28.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有在美国
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.38,1:03:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在寻找杀死他的凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.15,1:03:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后却是我自己 布伦达
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.18,1:03:40.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.19,1:03:42.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,亨利 你儿子说如果我找到凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.99,1:03:44.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就会知道怎样打败外星人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.02,1:03:47.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说的是对的 看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.03,1:03:51.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要做的就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.47,1:03:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁让这烂人从监狱出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.64,1:03:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他哥哥 治安长官
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.77,1:04:04.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的"A"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.65,1:04:11.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会死的 是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.95,1:04:18.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 没事的 我还没失去任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.16,1:04:21.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你弄丢了罗比 - 除了罗比
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.69,1:04:26.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在无所谓 重要的是我现在和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.17,1:04:28.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽量睡点觉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.37,1:04:31.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我唱摇篮曲好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.21,1:04:35.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.64,1:04:38.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我唱"静谧小山丘"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.24,1:04:40.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 我也不会
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.06,1:04:53.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要钱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.09,1:04:55.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就要做贱婊子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.20,1:05:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,贱婊子就能摇摇屁股拿小费
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.83,1:05:04.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,贱婊子就能脱衣到地板上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.37,1:05:07.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 她不是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.11,1:05:09.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,贱婊子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.05,1:05:19.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 进来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.55,1:05:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.22,1:05:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我名叫奥利弗 - 汤姆 赖安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.16,1:05:29.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发现了这个地方 有充足的食物
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.90,1:05:33.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有两具刚刚被杀死的尸体
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.83,1:05:37.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们原来是这地方的主人 我们要永远待在这
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.10,1:05:39.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怕吗 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.94,1:05:42.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不怕 我在死亡边缘很多次了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.18,1:05:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前在城里开救护车
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.74,1:05:48.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是 很明显 我不是个坚强的司机
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.41,1:05:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,看上去我杀死的人比救的人多
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.82,1:05:53.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,警报声让我兴奋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.59,1:05:57.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,打 屠杀
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.22,1:05:59.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,但现在不一样 这是场战争
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.73,1:06:02.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 这是灭绝
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.10,1:06:04.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,这还不如人类和蛆虫的战争
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.93,1:06:07.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者龙和狼的战争
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.33,1:06:11.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者人类骑着龙 把狼扔向蛆虫的战争
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.54,1:06:15.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠 汤姆 你明白我的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.31,1:06:17.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这项外星人一定有弱点
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.88,1:06:20.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说日本人用酱油杀死了一些
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.35,1:06:23.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,酱油 就是一种调料
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.25,1:06:25.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 低钠的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.08,1:06:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要说的是 汤姆 是你和我应该去抗争
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.32,1:06:30.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我们应该从地下出来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.79,1:06:32.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 我们可能会先要牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.93,1:06:34.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是是值得的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.33,1:06:36.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,清爽的微风 没有防晒霜 蠕虫
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.53,1:06:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们建立起自己的三脚架时 他们就四条腿了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.60,1:06:41.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你看样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.44,1:06:47.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们从挖地道过去吓死它们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.95,1:06:55.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,但愿有更多铁铲
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.62,1:07:06.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.96,1:08:15.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.50,1:08:17.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷切尔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.67,1:08:23.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷切尔 雷切尔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.85,1:08:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,秘密是什么 我错过了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.98,1:08:40.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 拜托 还有假怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.86,1:08:52.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.28,1:09:11.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.85,1:09:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓要找到你的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.64,1:09:32.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在哪 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.51,1:09:35.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,连在三脚架上的篮子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.38,1:09:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道 很可怕 可是为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.35,1:09:42.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,外星人要把我们怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.25,1:09:44.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道 但是它们什么人都要…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.25,1:09:46.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,小的 老的 富的 穷的 还有吓人的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.13,1:10:00.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 雷切尔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.30,1:10:03.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 爸爸 救命
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.77,1:10:05.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.51,1:10:18.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我死了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.25,1:10:20.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没死
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.06,1:10:32.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 布伦达 - 辛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.57,1:10:35.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 还有更糟的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.17,1:10:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你想换换 - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.51,1:10:44.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,布伦达 看
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.48,1:10:48.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不信 外星人杀死了恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.25,1:10:56.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 人类 欢迎到三角指挥部内部
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.16,1:10:59.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷切尔呢 你把我女儿怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.69,1:11:03.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,她很好 汤姆 但首先 我要做个游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.63,1:11:07.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们戴着的机关60秒后启动
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.50,1:11:11.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,辛迪身后的墙上的开关可以关掉它们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.04,1:11:13.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,但钥匙在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.97,1:11:15.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你个提示 辛迪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.01,1:11:18.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,游戏开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.81,1:11:22.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.62,1:11:27.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 也许这个能帮你看见
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.19,1:11:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要我切东西
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.86,1:11:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,很明显 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:44.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.77,1:11:49.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 钥匙在你眼睛后 明白
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.82,1:11:59.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,佐达 过来看看 这个人要动手了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.19,1:12:05.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,假眼
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.52,1:12:07.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,96年比赛时落下的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.27,1:12:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我希望这不影响我们的关系
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.27,1:12:22.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不影响
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.05,1:12:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试试这个还来得及吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.75,1:12:33.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静 游戏还没结束
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.12,1:12:37.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷切尔 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.86,1:12:40.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷切尔 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.23,1:12:48.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆 只有你能让你的孩子活着
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:51.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们命悬一线了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.71,1:12:57.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没想到吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.44,1:13:00.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,相反 在掌握中
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.15,1:13:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我称之为"胡桃钳"
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.92,1:13:10.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.92,1:13:13.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.33,1:13:24.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,天麸罗 寿司 生鱼片
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.44,1:13:30.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.78,1:13:34.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 按血缘关系 亨利是后爹
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.45,1:13:36.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你才是那小孩真正的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.02,1:13:38.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么时候见她的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.98,1:13:41.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,在卡波春游的时候 那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.52,1:13:43.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我搅进去了 严肃地说 谁他妈关心
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.92,1:13:45.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.76,1:13:49.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,享受你的紫奶头吧 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.97,1:13:55.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你 你儿子不想这样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.13,1:13:57.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的阴魂不散就因为你给他痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.00,1:14:00.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我跨过银河系来报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.71,1:14:02.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我的错 放过别人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.98,1:14:06.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不这么想 看着他挣扎吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.21,1:14:09.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 辛迪 看 我上电视了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.68,1:14:11.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要向所有偷窥我的人大喊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.22,1:14:15.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.99,1:14:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,没哪个贱人敢打布伦达
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:20.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,佐达 救命
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.73,1:14:24.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 真是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:27.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你因为你儿子的死 对人类下了咒怨
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.67,1:14:30.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 靠
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.07,1:14:33.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀死我们不会让你儿子回来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.37,1:14:36.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 你要为你做的负责
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.34,1:14:38.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,除此之外 我做了这个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.88,1:14:42.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这装置在你身上关上时 会锁住链条
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.02,1:14:45.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的孩子会得救
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.08,1:14:47.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是你死得很惨
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.75,1:14:50.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会为你爱的人坚持吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.49,1:14:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有60秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.19,1:14:57.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 别担心 孩子 我不会离开的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.40,1:15:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以走了 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.40,1:15:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你做的显示出你爱我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.24,1:15:07.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我你是真的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.57,1:15:10.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,还告诉我我可以再爱一次
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.28,1:15:13.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们原谅你 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.22,1:15:26.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,钉子 它们停了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.86,1:15:32.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 孩子们 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.57,1:15:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在拿我们的命开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.61,1:15:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,任何人都可以有咒怨
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.61,1:15:43.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是宽恕需要真的勇气
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.98,1:15:47.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 侵略结束了 - 还有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.98,1:15:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜我要道个歉什么的 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.12,1:15:52.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来你是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.82,1:15:54.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.82,1:15:57.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起杀死了上百万人 差不多啦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.49,1:16:00.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 布伦达呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.76,1:16:04.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.46,1:16:06.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在和平了 我刚才在签协议
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.13,1:16:11.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 布伦达 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.54,1:16:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见 佐达 别丢了我的号码
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.54,1:16:19.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我你没捉到什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.61,1:16:22.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 很爽 她说她是处女
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.72,1:16:27.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们太惨了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.30,1:16:44.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.11,1:16:50.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.81,1:16:54.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 看 孩子们 是外公
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.52,1:16:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 那是我的新老公
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.02,1:17:09.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得很浪漫 爱可以找到任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.57,1:17:17.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后 爱取得了胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.10,1:17:19.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,侵略者被打败了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.47,1:17:22.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,对这个世界 我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.27,1:17:24.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,是人之世界
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.31,1:17:27.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们赢得了住在这的权力
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.41,1:17:31.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我们爱 人道会盛行的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.85,1:17:35.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的敌人没能打败我们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.75,1:17:40.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个都受阻于它们自己的邪恶计划
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.56,1:17:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,在全世界 全银河系
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.10,1:17:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们屹立不倒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.83,1:17:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人能威胁我们的生存 没人能挑战我们的精神
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.54,1:17:54.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.54,1:17:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的品质让我们独一无二
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.91,1:18:00.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱是我们伟大的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.65,1:18:03.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为爱 人类
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.32,1:18:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 大家好 欢迎来到节目
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.62,1:18:14.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这次有特殊嘉宾带来特殊新闻
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.46,1:18:17.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 他在这大楼里 这个人拯救了世界
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.76,1:18:20.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们欢迎汤姆 赖安
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.10,1:18:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.65,1:18:36.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:44.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.42,1:18:46.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.33,1:18:53.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那么 你恋爱了 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.84,1:19:01.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他错过了 这小伙子错过了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.31,1:19:03.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:12.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你恋爱时很可爱 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.25,1:19:15.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说说她 - 她很棒 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.62,1:19:17.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么很复杂
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.36,1:19:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说她很复杂 我想
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.69,1:19:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:33.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 你疯了 汤姆 赖安疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.47,1:19:35.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我疯了 - 你高兴吗
